05:00.420 --> 05:03.720
Awan makam amu iti anak

05:03.720 --> 05:05.440
Nudilaeng ti ama

05:05.440 --> 05:08.120
Awan mat makam amu iti ama

05:08.120 --> 05:10.440
Nudilaeng ti anak

05:10.440 --> 05:12.820
Ken dagiti kayat ti anak

05:12.820 --> 05:14.420
Apangipaka amuan

05:14.420 --> 05:17.480
Simangon ni Jesus kadagiti adalan

05:17.480 --> 05:19.280
Katkinunana asililimit

05:19.280 --> 05:21.140
Nagasat kayo

05:21.140 --> 05:22.460
Gapo kadagiti mamasirib

05:22.560 --> 05:26.780
Ibagak kada kayo nga ado a profeta

05:26.780 --> 05:30.900
Ken ari tinagtarigagay akumita kadagiti makitayo

05:30.900 --> 05:34.180
Kendong ngag kadagiti mangyagyo

05:34.180 --> 05:36.440
Ngamdida nakita

05:36.440 --> 05:37.980
Wen nunang ngag

05:37.980 --> 05:42.640
Timakdar timaysa a maestro itilintag

05:42.640 --> 05:44.500
