05:44.500 --> 05:46.020
Maestro

05:46.020 --> 05:47.980
Sinaludsud na

05:47.980 --> 05:50.240
Anya timasapol nga aramide

05:50.240 --> 05:52.480
Tapnomagunod kutibiyag nga

05:52.480 --> 05:52.540
Ngunit na nga

05:52.560 --> 05:55.600
