05:55.600 --> 05:57.340
Kinunan ni Jesus

05:57.340 --> 05:59.640
Anya tipanagawat mo

05:59.640 --> 06:02.180
Ayatem ti apo at Diyos mo

06:02.180 --> 06:04.020
Iti amin apusong

06:04.020 --> 06:06.360
Iti amin akararwam

06:06.360 --> 06:08.580
Iti amin apigsam

06:08.580 --> 06:11.440
Ken iti amin apanunot mo

06:11.440 --> 06:14.780
Ken ayatem ti kaarubam

06:14.780 --> 06:16.940
Akas itibagim

06:16.940 --> 06:19.700
Insumbat ti maestro itilintag

06:19.700 --> 06:22.160
Kusto ti insumbat mo

06:22.160 --> 06:22.540
Kusto ti insumbat mo

06:22.560 --> 06:24.000
Kinunan ni Jesus

06:24.000 --> 06:25.980
Aramidam daytoy

06:25.980 --> 06:27.500
Ket agbiyagkanto

06:27.500 --> 06:29.460
Ngumkaya ti maestro

06:29.460 --> 06:31.120
Nga ikalintagan ti bagina

06:31.120 --> 06:32.840
Isotga po na

06:32.840 --> 06:34.100
Anagsaludsudmanan

06:34.100 --> 06:34.980
