Anagga po ija Jerusalem

06:42.960 --> 06:44.740
Ket sumalsalog

06:44.740 --> 06:46.020
Amapan ija Heriko

06:46.020 --> 06:49.100
Sinaneb dagit itulisan

06:49.100 --> 06:51.460
Inalada amin nga

06:51.460 --> 06:52.260
Daken kwana

06:52.260 --> 06:53.620
Agraman bado na

06:53.620 --> 06:55.940
Kinabgabil da

06:55.940 --> 06:57.680
