07:52.100 --> 07:55.040
Ket intid na itiagpad padagus

07:55.040 --> 07:56.780
Taripatwem

07:56.780 --> 07:58.640
Kinunanak ken kwana

07:58.640 --> 08:00.960
Ket intunag subliak

08:00.960 --> 08:04.120
Bayadak to amin anagastun

08:04.120 --> 08:06.240
Kinunangarod ni Jesus

08:06.240 --> 08:07.920
