08:33.440 --> 08:35.000
Sadyay

08:35.000 --> 08:37.180
Adamaysa ababaing

08:37.180 --> 08:38.460
Agnagan Marta

08:38.460 --> 08:41.060
Anang sangailikan kwana itibalay na

08:41.060 --> 08:43.060
At dakapsat na

08:43.060 --> 08:44.540
Nga agnagan Maria

08:44.540 --> 08:47.280
Anagtugaw itisakaanan ti apo

08:47.280 --> 08:50.060
Ket nagdangag itipanursur na

08:50.060 --> 08:52.080
Gapu tamaring

08:52.100 --> 08:54.680
Ang guran ni Marta itipanagsagsaganan na

08:54.680 --> 08:56.760
Napan kin Jesus

08:56.760 --> 08:58.040
Apo

08:58.040 --> 08:59.880
Kinunan na

08:59.880 --> 09:01.980
Awan ka di anyaman na kin ka

09:01.980 --> 09:03.820
Abaybay anak ni kabsat ko

09:03.820 --> 09:06.340
Ket si siyak tiagsagsaganan

09:06.340 --> 09:08.560
Ibagaman kin kwana

09:08.560 --> 09:09.880
Tatulungan nak

09:09.880 --> 09:11.940
Insumbat ti apo

09:11.940 --> 09:13.980
Marta

09:13.980 --> 09:15.260
Marta

09:15.260 --> 09:17.880
Adula amin apakaring guran

09:17.880 --> 09:19.880
Nga may salaeng timasapol

09:20.580 --> 09:21.880
Pinili natin

09:22.100 --> 09:23.660
